<title>USA: Clinton, Canadian prime minister to meet April 8.</title>
<headline>Clinton, Canadian prime minister to meet April 8.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton will meet Canadian Prime Minister Jean Chretien in Washington on April 8, the White House said on Monday.</p>
<p>The White House said in a brief statement that the two leaders, who last met in November at the APEC trade summit in Manilla, would discuss a variety of issues, including how to deepen their countries' &quot;exceptionally  close&quot; ties.</p>
</text>
